:depth rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
       rdfs:domain :Leadership ;
       rdfs:range xsd:int ;
       rdfs:label "depth"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/diversify-ccam/ontologies/culture/easeOfProcess
:easeOfProcess rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
